<task id="015" project="spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>SPA: Add event with type/priority/assignee/description; Event record template (child record + deep link) with Edit and Change status (FR-35, FR-36, FR-37)</title>
    <phase>1 Record template and actions (post-E2E rework, round 3)</phase>
    <gate>014 merged (its contract is the source of truth; build against the merged DTOs, not the design)</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>.tsx in the SPA; a new record template; nested child dialogs; hide-don't-disable rules</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Reuses the record template, ChildRecordModal, FormModal and recordAccess patterns already in the SPA</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches EventsCalendar.tsx, recordTemplates.ts and web-api-client.ts</parallel-reason>
    <deps>014</deps>
    <tags>frontend, react, fluent-ui, testing</tags>
    <estimated-effort>1.5-2 days</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Owner retest round 3 (2026-11-15) and decisions Q-1–Q-8, S-1–S-4: an Event Type lookup and the missing fields on Add event, and an Event record that opens, links, edits and changes status.</prompt>
  <goal>Add event offers Event Type (required, from `creatableEventTypes`), Due Date (required by type), Priority, Assigned To (from assignable people) and Description; clicking an Events row opens a `sprk_event` record as a child record over the current record; `?record=event:{id}` opens it top-level; the toolbar shows Edit, Change status, Copy link and Delete exactly when the BFF allows each.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Design: `notes/event-forms-design.md` §2–§3. SPA today: `EventsCalendar.tsx` create dialog `:388-575` (Event/Task radio `:547`), rows `:326-382` (no open); `web-api-client.ts` events `:114`, `:558-773` (`createRootEvent` `:718`, no update). Child record: `record/ChildRecordModal.tsx`, `record/childRecord.ts` (task 013, one level). Deep link: `RecordDeepLink` + `RouterRecordOpener` (project CLAUDE.md §6, task 007 gotcha: `?record=` is the app-wide deep link). Templates: `record/recordTemplates.ts`; access helpers: `record/recordAccess.ts` (add to it, don't re-derive). Child dialogs: `useChildDialog`; tests wait ~350 ms after open and install `tests/jsdomLayout.ts` (D-8).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/external-spa/src/components/EventsCalendar.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/external-spa/src/api/web-api-client.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/recordTemplates.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/recordAccess.ts</file>
      <file role="create">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/actions/EventEditAction.tsx</file>
      <file role="create">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/actions/EventStatusAction.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/ChildRecordModal.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/actions/SubmitInvoiceAction.tsx</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-35">The Event/Task radio is removed; Event Type is a required dropdown fed only by `creatableEventTypes`; no client-side type list or GUID literal. Due Date is required when the chosen type says `requiresDueDate`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-36 / owner S-1, S-3, S-4">Edit and Change status show only when the row's `canEdit` / `canChangeStatus` is true (hide, don't disable); Change status lists `allowedStatuses`; Event Type is read-only in Edit. No action the UI offers may answer 403.</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-37">Assigned To options come only from `assignable-people`, "Me" first; asked only when the caller may create or edit; a failed load hides the field with a short message, never blocks create.</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-03 / ADR-050">Edit and Change status are SprkModal FormModal children of the event record; Cancel left; Esc follows the modal standard (project CLAUDE.md §3, 2026-11-11). One child-record level: an event opened as a child does not open a further record from its Regarding link (it navigates the top-level record instead, or is plain text — pick one, test it, note it).</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-36 deep link">`?record=event:{id}` uses `GET /events/{id}`; a 404 shows the existing uniform not-found state.</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-05">Toolbar icons from the icon map only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">KEEP paths; banned mocks per ADR-038.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r4/notes/event-forms-design.md</file>
      <file>projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r4/CLAUDE.md</file>
